#. Snackbar shown after the device name is saved. Used in Main/Account/Settings/SettingsView.swift.
msgctxt "device_name_updated"
msgid "Device name updated"
msgstr "Το όνομα της συσκευής ενημερώθηκε"

#. Hint shown when the device is not discoverable because provide mode is off.
