msgstr "Πληρώστε με το πορτοφόλι Solana"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "pay_with_stripe"
msgid "Join with Stripe"
msgstr "Εγγραφείτε με Stripe"

#. Shown when the post-payment confirmation poll exhausts its budget (2 minutes) without the server confirming the subscription. The payment evidence is real (store or payment sheet reported success), so say that plainly, and head off a second purchase. Android also shows it, without the "Payment received" title, when the 2-minute Solana Pay return-path check ends without the payment landing.
msgctxt "payment_confirmation_delayed"
msgid "Confirmation is taking longer than expected. Your plan will update automatically once it's confirmed — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "Η επιβεβαίωση αργεί περισσότερο από το αναμενόμενο. Το πρόγραμμά σας θα ενημερωθεί αυτόματα μόλις επιβεβαιωθεί — δεν χρειάζεται να αγοράσετε ξανά."

#. Body of the post-purchase overlay while the server has not yet confirmed the subscription. Replaces the optimistic 'You're premium.' claim until currentSubscription actually confirms.
msgctxt "payment_confirmation_processing"
msgid "We're confirming your payment now. Your plan will update automatically — you don't need to do anything."
msgstr "Επιβεβαιώνουμε τώρα την πληρωμή σας. Το πρόγραμμά σας θα ενημερωθεί αυτόματα — δεν χρειάζεται να κάνετε τίποτα."

#. Shown in the payment-problem dialog when the Stripe payment sheet reports a failure. The sheet's own error detail is appended by the caller.
msgctxt "payment_not_completed"
msgid "Your payment could not be completed."
msgstr "Η πληρωμή σας δεν ήταν δυνατό να ολοκληρωθεί."

#. Billing errors. Every one is shown to the user WITH a remedy: a payment error they cannot see is a payment error they will hit again.
msgctxt "payment_problem"
msgid "Payment problem"
msgstr "Πρόβλημα πληρωμής"

#. Title of the post-purchase screen while the server has not yet confirmed the entitlement (Shared/Views/PurchaseSuccessView.swift). StoreKit took the payment; the confirmation poll is still running — the copy must not claim premium yet.
msgctxt "payment_received"
msgid "Payment received."
msgstr "Η πληρωμή ελήφθη."

#. Title for the post-purchase overlay and the confirmation-timeout dialog. Deliberately claims only what is known -- the payment was received -- not that the plan is active yet.
msgctxt "payment_received_title"
msgid "Payment received"
msgstr "Η πληρωμή ελήφθη"

