#. The VLESS settings: the Settings row and screen title, and the row on the login screen's network settings. VLESS is a proxy protocol name.
msgctxt "vless"
msgid "VLESS"
msgstr "VLESS"

#. VLESS settings: the switch that skips the VLESS server's certificate check (TLS only). The app's own traffic stays encrypted.
msgctxt "vless_allow_insecure"
msgid "Allow an insecure certificate"
msgstr "Να επιτρέπεται μη ασφαλές πιστοποιητικό"

#. VLESS settings: the TLS ALPN list field label. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_alpn"
msgid "ALPN"
msgstr "ALPN"

#. VLESS settings: the button that copies the settings as a vless:// share link.
msgctxt "vless_copy_link"
msgid "Copy link"
msgstr "Αντιγραφή συνδέσμου"

#. VLESS settings: the switch that turns the VLESS server on or off.
msgctxt "vless_enabled"
msgid "Use VLESS"
msgstr "Χρήση VLESS"

#. VLESS settings error: the server address is missing or malformed.
msgctxt "vless_error_address_invalid"
msgid "Enter the server address."
msgstr "Εισαγάγετε τη διεύθυνση του διακομιστή."

#. VLESS settings error: the TLS fingerprint name is not one this app knows.
msgctxt "vless_error_fingerprint_unsupported"
msgid "This TLS fingerprint is not supported."
msgstr "Αυτό το αποτύπωμα TLS δεν υποστηρίζεται."

#. VLESS settings error: the Vision flow needs the TCP transport and TLS or REALITY security, or the flow is unknown. Vision, TCP, TLS and REALITY are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_flow_invalid"
msgid "The Vision flow works only with the TCP transport and TLS or REALITY security."
msgstr "Η ροή Vision λειτουργεί μόνο με τη μεταφορά TCP και ασφάλεια TLS ή REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the user ID is missing or is not a UUID (or a custom ID of up to 30 bytes).
msgctxt "vless_error_id_invalid"
msgid "Enter the user ID (a UUID)."
msgstr "Εισαγάγετε το αναγνωριστικό χρήστη (UUID)."

#. VLESS settings error: the pasted text is not a vless:// share link.
msgctxt "vless_error_link_invalid"
msgid "This is not a valid VLESS link."
msgstr "Αυτός δεν είναι έγκυρος σύνδεσμος VLESS."

#. VLESS settings error: the link asks for a VLESS feature this app does not implement (for example VLESS encryption).
msgctxt "vless_error_link_unsupported"
msgid "This link uses a VLESS feature this app does not support."
msgstr "Αυτός ο σύνδεσμος χρησιμοποιεί μια λειτουργία VLESS που δεν υποστηρίζει αυτή η εφαρμογή."

#. VLESS settings error: the transport is one this app does not implement (for example gRPC or XHTTP). TCP, WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_network_unsupported"
msgid "This transport is not supported. Use TCP, WebSocket or HTTPUpgrade."
msgstr "Αυτή η μεταφορά δεν υποστηρίζεται. Χρησιμοποιήστε TCP, WebSocket ή HTTPUpgrade."

#. VLESS settings error: the port is missing or outside 1 to 65535.
msgctxt "vless_error_port_invalid"
msgid "Enter a port from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "Εισαγάγετε μια θύρα από 1 έως 65535."

#. VLESS settings error: the REALITY public key is missing or is not 32 bytes of base64. REALITY is a protocol name.
msgctxt "vless_error_public_key_invalid"
msgid "Enter the REALITY public key."
msgstr "Εισαγάγετε το δημόσιο κλειδί του REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the security type is one this app does not implement. TLS and REALITY are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_security_unsupported"
msgid "This security type is not supported. Use TLS, REALITY or none."
msgstr "Αυτός ο τύπος ασφάλειας δεν υποστηρίζεται. Χρησιμοποιήστε TLS, REALITY ή κανέναν."

#. VLESS settings error: REALITY needs the server name (SNI) of the site it borrows. REALITY and SNI are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_server_name_required"
msgid "Enter the server name (SNI) for REALITY."
msgstr "Εισαγάγετε το όνομα διακομιστή (SNI) για το REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the REALITY short ID is longer than 16 hexadecimal characters or is not hexadecimal. REALITY is a protocol name.
msgctxt "vless_error_short_id_invalid"
msgid "The REALITY short ID must be up to 16 hexadecimal characters."
msgstr "Το σύντομο αναγνωριστικό REALITY πρέπει να έχει έως 16 δεκαεξαδικούς χαρακτήρες."

#. VLESS settings: the picker of the browser TLS hello the connection imitates (chrome, firefox, ...).
msgctxt "vless_fingerprint"
msgid "TLS fingerprint"
msgstr "Αποτύπωμα TLS"

#. VLESS settings: the flow picker label (none or Vision). A VLESS protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_flow"
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "Ροή"

#. VLESS settings: the Vision flow option (xtls-rprx-vision). A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_flow_vision"
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Vision"

#. VLESS settings: the HTTP Host header field label of the WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade transports. Host is a protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_host_header"
msgid "Host header"
msgstr "Κεφαλίδα Host"

#. VLESS settings: the label of the share link field (a vless:// link).
msgctxt "vless_link"
msgid "VLESS link"
msgstr "Σύνδεσμος VLESS"

#. VLESS settings: confirmation after copying the share link.
msgctxt "vless_link_copied"
msgid "VLESS link copied"
msgstr "Ο σύνδεσμος VLESS αντιγράφηκε"

#. VLESS settings: the hint under the share link field. vless:// is literal and must not be translated.
msgctxt "vless_link_hint"
msgid "Paste a vless:// link to fill in the settings."
msgstr "Επικολλήστε έναν σύνδεσμο vless:// για να συμπληρωθούν οι ρυθμίσεις."

#. VLESS settings: the HTTPUpgrade transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_httpupgrade"
msgid "HTTPUpgrade"
msgstr "HTTPUpgrade"

#. VLESS settings: the TCP transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_tcp"
msgid "TCP"
msgstr "TCP"

#. VLESS settings: the WebSocket transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_ws"
msgid "WebSocket"
msgstr "WebSocket"

#. VLESS settings: the button that reads a vless:// link from the clipboard or the link field.
msgctxt "vless_paste_link"
msgid "Paste link"
msgstr "Επικόλληση συνδέσμου"

#. VLESS settings: the HTTP path field label of the WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade transports.
msgctxt "vless_path"
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Διαδρομή"

#. VLESS settings: the server port field label.
msgctxt "vless_port"
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Θύρα"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY public key field label.
msgctxt "vless_public_key"
msgid "Public key"
msgstr "Δημόσιο κλειδί"

#. VLESS settings: the security picker label (none, TLS or REALITY).
msgctxt "vless_security"
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Ασφάλεια"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY security option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_security_reality"
msgid "REALITY"
msgstr "REALITY"

#. VLESS settings: the TLS security option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_security_tls"
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#. VLESS settings: the server host name or IP address field label.
msgctxt "vless_server_address"
msgid "Server address"
msgstr "Διεύθυνση διακομιστή"

#. VLESS settings: the TLS server name field label. SNI is a protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_server_name"
msgid "Server name (SNI)"
msgstr "Όνομα διακομιστή (SNI)"

#. VLESS settings: the explanation at the top of the screen. VLESS is a proxy protocol; the user's own server carries the app's connections to URnetwork when direct connections are blocked.
msgctxt "vless_settings_description"
msgid "Connect to URnetwork through your own VLESS server when direct connections are blocked. Your traffic to URnetwork stays encrypted end to end."
msgstr "Συνδεθείτε στο URnetwork μέσω του δικού σας διακομιστή VLESS όταν οι άμεσες συνδέσεις είναι αποκλεισμένες. Η κίνησή σας προς το URnetwork παραμένει κρυπτογραφημένη από άκρο σε άκρο."

#. VLESS settings: note after saving where the VPN service runs separately from the app (the iOS tunnel extension, the desktop service). It reads the settings at its next start.
msgctxt "vless_settings_next_connect"
msgid "The VPN uses the new VLESS settings the next time it connects."
msgstr "Το VPN θα χρησιμοποιήσει τις νέες ρυθμίσεις VLESS την επόμενη φορά που θα συνδεθεί."

#. VLESS settings: confirmation after saving.
msgctxt "vless_settings_saved"
msgid "VLESS settings saved"
msgstr "Οι ρυθμίσεις VLESS αποθηκεύτηκαν"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY short ID field label.
msgctxt "vless_short_id"
msgid "Short ID"
msgstr "Σύντομο αναγνωριστικό"

#. VLESS settings: the user ID field label. The ID is a UUID the server issued.
msgctxt "vless_user_id"
msgid "User ID (UUID)"
msgstr "Αναγνωριστικό χρήστη (UUID)"

#. Upgrade screen, when a connect blocked by insufficient balance opened it: closes the screen to wait for the free daily data instead of upgrading.
msgctxt "wait_for_refresh"
msgid "Wait for refresh"
msgstr "Αναμονή για ανανέωση"

#. Used in Shared/Views/UpgradeSubscriptionSheet.swift.
msgctxt "waiting_for_approval"
msgid "Waiting for approval"
msgstr "Αναμονή έγκρισης"

#. A message displayed when waiting for a wallet signature.
msgctxt "waiting_for_wallet_signature"
msgid "Waiting for wallet signature..."
msgstr "Αναμονή για υπογραφή πορτοφολιού..."

#. Account Screen
msgctxt "wallet"
msgid "Wallet"
msgstr "Πορτοφόλι"

#. Error when a wallet address is on the operator's ban list; the user cannot continue.
msgctxt "wallet_blocked"
msgid "This wallet can't be used with URnetwork."
msgstr "Αυτό το πορτοφόλι δεν μπορεί να χρησιμοποιηθεί με το URnetwork."

#. Error shown when connecting an external wallet to the account fails.
msgctxt "wallet_connect_failed"
msgid "Failed to connect the wallet."
msgstr "Δεν ήταν δυνατή η σύνδεση του πορτοφολιού."

#. Note under the manual address entry: the wallet only signs a proof of ownership.
msgctxt "wallet_connect_signed_note_linux"
msgid "Your wallet signs a message to prove it is yours. Nothing is sent on chain."
msgstr "Το πορτοφόλι σας υπογράφει ένα μήνυμα για να αποδείξει ότι είναι δικό σας. Τίποτα δεν αποστέλλεται στην αλυσίδα."

#. Confirmation shown after an external wallet is connected to the account.
msgctxt "wallet_connected"
msgid "Wallet connected."
msgstr "Το πορτοφόλι συνδέθηκε."

#. Line under the connected coldkey.
msgctxt "wallet_connected_to_protocol"
msgid "Connected to the UR protocol. Claims land here. Alpha accrues from the next epoch after connecting."
msgstr "Συνδέθηκε στο πρωτόκολλο UR. Οι διεκδικήσεις καταλήγουν εδώ. Το Alpha συσσωρεύεται από την εποχή μετά τη σύνδεση."

#. Warning when a wallet address has no activity on the Bittensor chain yet; the user may continue.
msgctxt "wallet_looks_new_warning"
msgid "This address has no activity on the Bittensor chain yet. It looks like a new wallet. Make sure it is yours before continuing."
msgstr "Αυτή η διεύθυνση δεν έχει ακόμη δραστηριότητα στην αλυσίδα Bittensor. Μοιάζει με νέο πορτοφόλι. Βεβαιωθείτε ότι είναι δικό σας πριν συνεχίσετε."

#. Shown on the create-network step after a wallet sign-in when the wallet isn't linked to any network yet. The user picks a network name and accepts the terms to create one; the wallet signature carries over.
msgctxt "wallet_needs_network"
msgid "This wallet isn't linked to a network yet. Pick a network name to create one."
msgstr "Αυτό το πορτοφόλι δεν είναι ακόμη συνδεδεμένο με κάποιο δίκτυο. Επιλέξτε ένα όνομα δικτύου για να δημιουργήσετε ένα."

#. Line on the wallet block before a wallet is connected.
msgctxt "wallet_not_retroactive"
msgid "Connect a wallet to earn SN25α from the next epoch. Earlier epochs are not settled retroactively."
msgstr "Συνδέστε ένα πορτοφόλι για να κερδίζετε SN25α από την επόμενη εποχή. Οι προηγούμενες εποχές δεν εκκαθαρίζονται αναδρομικά."

#. Accessibility label of the three-dot overflow button next to “Connect Bittensor wallet” and on the connected Bittensor wallet block.
msgctxt "wallet_options"
msgid "Wallet options"
